    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "but it doesn't feel like a canvas. it just feels like... nothing. there's no more fuel. i've spent my whole life pouring everything into this, and now that it's empty, i don't know what's left of me. it's like i'm just a shell waiting for a light that's never coming back. what's the point of just existing if the part that made me 'me' is gone?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
